    "Description": "Condenses a molecule into 1,024 features assembled by Ersilia for use across its own modelling work, bundling complementary descriptor families into one compact vector so that downstream models need only a single featurisation step. The representation underpinned the automated virtual screening cascade deployed with the H3D Centre in Cape Town, where low computational cost mattered as much as accuracy. Dimensions are not individually interpretable and are intended as input to classifiers or regressors.",
